WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.570
Your next class starts with one clear invitation.

00:00:04.370 --> 00:00:07.310
Once you are accepted and your email is verified,

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:11.750
scheduled class invitations bring the topic, date, time zone,

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.390
and joining link together.

00:00:14.570 --> 00:00:17.250
Check the time zone before adding the class to

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:17.890
your plans.

00:00:18.410 --> 00:00:21.510
When it is time, open the joining link in

00:00:21.510 --> 00:00:22.310
your invitation.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.770
You can also sign in to the Academy and open

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:29.570
My classroom to find your scheduled class.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:34.830
If a class changes, check the latest update and

00:00:34.830 --> 00:00:36.370
the current classroom details.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.410
Need help finding your class?

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.870
Open Need help on the website and leave the

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.270
Academy team a message.

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:46.490
Check the details.

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.470
Join your class.

00:00:48.910 --> 00:00:50.330
Bring your questions.
